  "flavor_text_entries": [
    {
      "flavor_text": "ウロコを　うちだして　こうげきする。\n２ー５かいの　あいだ　れんぞくで　だす。\nすばやさが　あがるが　ぼうぎょが　さがる。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      },
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "비늘을 쏘아서 공격한다.\n2-5회 동안 연속으로 쓴다.\n스피드가 올라가지만 방어가 떨어진다.",
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      },
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "射出鱗片進行攻擊。\n可連續攻擊２～５次。\n速度會提高但防禦會降低。",
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hant",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/4/"
      },
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Le lanceur projette des écailles sur la cible de deux à\ncinq fois d’affilée. Augmente la Vitesse, mais diminue\nla Défense.",
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      },
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Der Anwender greift das Ziel zwei- bis fünfmal\nhintereinander mit Schuppen-Geschossen an. Erhöht\ndie eigene Initiative, aber senkt die Verteidigung.",
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      },
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Lanza escamas al objetivo de dos a cinco veces\nseguidas. Aumenta la Velocidad del usuario, pero\nreduce su Defensa.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      },
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Il Pokémon attacca lanciando delle squame da due\na cinque volte di fila. Aumenta la Velocità di chi la usa,\nma ne riduce la Difesa.",
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      },
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "The user attacks by shooting scales two to five times\nin a row. This move boosts the user’s Speed stat but\nlowers its Defense stat.",
      "language": {
